WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Welcome to Your Next Season. I’m Brian Kennedy

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.160
Jr. Your goal is a workable weekly plan.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.880
Block your fixed commitments in a real weekly

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.000
calendar before adding one new goal. Keep your

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.640
work private, record what you tried, and set

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:17.280
a review date. This planning resource is not

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.600
therapy or individualized mental-health care.
